Description: Windows 11 style quick settings for the Xfce panel
 Shopno Quick Settings is a panel plugin for Xfce modelled on the Windows 11
 quick settings flyout.
 .
 It has tiles for Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Focus assist and Night light, sliders
 for screen brightness and volume, the battery level, and network, volume
 and battery icons on the panel button. It talks to NetworkManager, BlueZ,
 PulseAudio or PipeWire, UPower and logind directly, and follows the GTK
 and icon theme.
